g Connector | Medium | Medium (Missing URL bug) | Medium | | </span><span style="font-weight:700">Europeana</span><span>&nbsp;| Image / Text | REST / SPARQL | Medium (3,000 req/day key limit) | High (edm:rights structured) | Conditional (License filter dependent) | Direct Media URLs | REST API Plugin | Low | Low | High | | </span><span style="font-weight:700">Flickr Commons</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;| Image | REST API | High (Key required) | High (Numeric license IDs) | Conditional (license filter) | Direct Original URLs (url_o) | REST API Plugin | Low | Medium (License parse risk) | High |</span></p><h3 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:14pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Asset-Resolution Matrix</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12.8pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span>| Capability | Existing Solution | Integration Layer | Free/Local? | Rights Support | Limitation | Custom Need? | Confidence | | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | | </span><span style="font-weight:700">Image Search</span><span>&nbsp;| Pexels, Wikimedia, Adobe Stock APIs | MCP / API Connectors | Hybrid (Free &amp; Sub) | High (extmetadata, Pexels, Stock) | Rate limits on free tiers | No | High | | </span><span style="font-weight:700">Video Search</span><span>&nbsp;| Pexels Video, Internet Archive, Adobe Stock | MCP / API Connectors | Hybrid (Free &amp; Sub) | High (Metadata tags &amp; API flags) | Archive video resolution varies | No | High | | </span><span