h | | </span><span style="font-weight:700">Rights Classification</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">| Multi-Source Rights Filter Engine | Python Middleware | Free / Local | High (8-state normalized taxonomy) | Heterogeneous API license formats | Yes (Normalizer module) | High |</span></p><h4 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:12pt;padding-bottom:12.8pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Works cited</span></h4><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">1. Internet Archive API ‚Äî Search, Metadata &amp; Files - Apify, https://apify.com/insight.solutions/internet-archive-api 2. Archive.org Scraper - Apify, https://apify.com/lulzasaur/archive-org-scraper 3. internetarchive/internetarchive/item.py at master - GitHub, https://github.com/jjjake/internetarchive/blob/master/internetarchive/item.py 4. MCP server for the Internet Archive ‚Äî search, metadata ... - GitHub, https://github.com/dthen/internet-archive-mcp 5. Commons:Machine-readable data, https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Machine-readable_data 6. pyWikiCommons - PyPI, https://pypi.org/project/pyWikiCommons/ 7. cyanheads/smithsonian-mcp-server - GitHub, https://github.com/cyanheads/smithsonian-mcp-server 8. GitHub - molanojustin/smithsonian-mcp: A Model Context Protocol, https://github.com/molanojustin/smithsonian-mcp 9. Museums and the machine-processable web / Museum APIs, http://museum-api.pbworks.com/w/page/219334